# Data Directory

This directory contains the dataset used for the Kaduna State Infrastructure Performance Analytics project.

## Folder Structure

```text
data/
├── raw/
│   └── kaduna_infrastructure_original.xlsx
├── processed/
└── README.md
```

## Raw Dataset
The original Excel workbook was obtained from the Kaduna State Public Procurement Authority (KADPPA) open data portal.

**Original file:** `kaduna_infrastructure_original.xlsx`

**Source:** https://ipdata.kdsg.gov.ng/public/open-data

The workbook contains infrastructure project and procurement-related fields, including project identifiers, project titles, descriptions, status, type, budget information, dates, locations and procuring entities.

## Data Preparation
The dataset was inspected and transformed using Power Query in Power BI Desktop. The cleaning work included:
- Checking column quality, distribution and profile statistics.
- Removing two completely empty columns from the cleaned query.
- Applying Trim and Clean to relevant text columns.
- Checking date columns and retaining genuine missing date values.
- Reviewing possible duplicate project identifiers.

## Processed Data
No separate processed CSV or Excel export was created for this project. The transformation steps are saved within the Power BI file in the `power_bi/` directory.

## Data Limitations
Some columns contain missing or incomplete information. In particular, the sector and tender value fields were empty in the inspected dataset, while project dates and tender-related fields had substantial missing values.

Please refer to the project report for the detailed data quality assessment.
